    "Each task label is an integer in [-1000000000,1000000000].",
    "The elapsed interval count may exceed signed 32-bit range."
  ],
  "interface": "Solution.solve(tasks, cooldown) receives a native integer array and an integer; return a long integer.",
  "inputSchema": {
    "kind": "object",
